    "sd20261013-be75072761e1": "County, map location and arrival remain unverified. Physical hole count and component inventory remain unverified. Guest-fee round lengths and repeated front/back rating tables do not establish physical counts. Association address combines street and PO Box; purpose remains published_unspecified. ",
    "sd20261013-8725aaa152a2": "Individually labeled Public by the South Dakota Golf Association. No access inference from association membership or directory inclusion.",
    "sd20261013-a1a165eafb90": "County, map location and arrival remain unverified. Physical hole count and component inventory remain unverified. Guest-fee round lengths and repeated front/back rating tables do not establish physical counts. ",
    "sd20261013-509d13beaab8": "Individually labeled Public by the South Dakota Golf Association. No access inference from association membership or directory inclusion.",
    "sd20261013-e807aa071af5": "County, map location and arrival remain unverified. Municipality explicitly reports a 27-hole facility and Physical Address. Exact address purpose beyond a physical facility address is unverified. Components remain unreviewed; no division of 27 into course rows or use of playing-round/rating combinations as physical layouts. ",
    "sd20261013-reuse-qualification": "Bare facility facts with independent summaries; no website prose, imagery or scorecard artwork imported. SDGA, operator and municipal websites are not claimed as openly licensed data. Relevant robots and policy observations are retained in the South Dakota cohort review. State GFP permits informational use with third-party-rights and accuracy qualifications. These facts do not inherit the MIT software license.",
